<description>&lt;p&gt;Kenyan-led forces and Erik Prince's contractors are using drones and air support to strike gang positions in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff, while Sri Lankan police, army and a Bangladesh UN advance team have been deployed to Haiti. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and allocated US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. Four soldiers are missing after a gang attack and five Salvadoran soldiers disappeared following an ambush, showing continued threats to foreign troops. Elections remain on hold as gangs adapt to the security crackdown, and 193 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPRUFEakRnZjRqRG1ReDZMZ3huOWxnYnkzREZjdUhndG5wTUp0VDhvREdaSTY2ek5KYWw5ZThsSHNtWVRFd3J1b3AtME5jekdsa2VTVGdsZkpQTjV3LWZhblZVZjZMcldTVGxXZ1ZMeGVITlFaQXJNdFZIQ21mSXFXcVRLNVVoLXpCV1BOUTJabDNmWDA0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5KNXNySHFZbDNPRFJZS2NGbFExa0FNRFJ3N212MEljWndIdnVSMzZUT0d3RTlaanFkQ1JjN2NReGNNbzlkVG1QTkFlWXBBN3FVNXhxTXc4ZWxFczg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQY0d2aEtVRU95X3JnOXVxN3EyTl9hSF9LVFBxZ3FGLXFfX0dSZTNmbnRlNnl3OEtWaVg2UVpqc0RTZUZSVWJnZmNTb1o3TnhWMUk1dDR0MTNNRTZlX2wycmZlSjlyeXZQaHotVHpvZFA2UWl2VUxPclZUWGV1b0N1Q2xtREdVQ0V6S0djNnBlc05KT29wU2lKc241Y2hvaHhPRVdwLXJEMXUzUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOZ2c0Uk1WaGQtMlNSQU5BRWpJZlk3aGtWQTRSTW5jZU5kQUNhNlRaVVBsbjA5OFExRkppb21VVE0zUEdtd1FtZ2l2eXp4clNxUTFDV0xYM05hVHVRM0VqQXdodjJnZU9uQThRR0cwemlPNUpkXzBHS1ZwWmZBWGsyRFZTVDVaa01ySGQxVWdGbk9uZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles